{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">沙田隆亨邨有私家車撞欄後停下，警方在車內檢獲毒品，司機涉販運危險藥物被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指，涉事私家車在昨晚九時許撞毀隆亨邨停車場入口附近鐵欄。37歲男司機棄車離開，後來報警訛稱遇劫。警員在車內檢獲16粒懷疑毒品依托米酯及少量懷疑可卡因等，數量及價值有待點算。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAR.DRUG-0300.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026PE4AhhQOcP1789428461.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CAR.DRUG-0300.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在附近發現報案男子，調查後相信與事實不符，以誤導警務人員及涉嫌販運危險藥物罪名，將他拘捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T01:49:53.316456+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}